## NFS Debug on Worker Node

```bash
# SSH into worker
ssh root@k8s-worker1

# Check NFS mounts
mount | grep nfs

# Check if NAS reachable
showmount -e 10.0.40.120

# Kernel NFS messages
dmesg | grep -i nfs | tail -20

# NFS mount stats
nfsstat -m

# Test if mount is stale (hangs = stale)
timeout 5 ls /var/lib/kubelet/pods/

# Full kernel mount table
cat /proc/mounts | grep nfs

# Kubelet NFS errors
journalctl -u kubelet | grep -i nfs | tail -20
```

