## Trigger etcd Backup Manually

```bash
kubectl create job --from=cronjob/etcd-backup etcd-backup-dr-test -n etcd-backup
kubectl get pods -n etcd-backup -w
kubectl logs -n etcd-backup <job-pod> --all-containers
```

