## Recovery Checks After NAS Restored

```bash
# 1. NAS reachable
showmount -e 10.0.40.120

# 2. All PVCs still Bound
kubectl get pvc -A | grep -v Bound

# 3. No new Released PVs
kubectl get pv | grep Released

# 4. All pods healthy
kubectl get pods -A | grep -v Running | grep -v Completed

# 5. WordPress accessible
curl -I https://wordpress-dev.lab.local

# 6. MariaDB data intact
kubectl exec -it mariadb-0 -n database -c mariadb -- mariadb -u root -p -e "use wordpress; show tables;"

# 7. Flux healthy
flux get kustomization
```